{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13801","headline":"晋公魏国夫人柳氏挽歌 · 顾况","name":"晋公魏国夫人柳氏挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鱼轩海上遥，鸾影月中销。\n双剑来时合，孤桐去日凋。\n夕阳迷陇隧，秋雨咽笳箫。\n画翣无留影，铭旌已度桥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}